            "notes": "Round 3\n\nFor our round 3 Power we will grab  [Out with a Bang](item_0c3398a1-34aa-48d0-81c1-0e4f1cf4f739) so we can have 3 additional \"sticky\" dynamites to shoot and explode giving additional burn damage and overall lethality to change the tides of a team fight.\n\nwe are gonna pick up  [Silver Lighter](item_858f4336-77ae-4a2d-b26d-cce6e939c54e) for our first item so we can get more AP% and gain more ult charge!\n\nWe grab  [Multi-Tool](item_5ba8d94e-f2f3-44b7-8773-025fc6ed7c56) for more AP% but also more cooldown to get dynamite faster\n\nP.S, I found out a very OP way to use this build at round 3 which will make the entire enemy team DESPISE YOU!. When you throw your dynamite at an enemy or tank on point and explode it on the tank the three dynamite will pop up, when you use your coach gun it will deal additional damage but also INSTANTLY POP the other 3 DYNAMITE, GIVING IT UNSTOPPABLE DAMAGE TO THE ENEMY, which will literally MELT ANYONE!. (trying to learn how to make a video to show this better)",
